<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1T - Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli kwa Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jhukutumbula jha Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo cha kutumbula cha Timocheyo ndi baluwa chikajhandikwe na Ntenga Pauli kujhenda kwa mmola gwake Timocheyo. Kitabo chenje kikajhandikwe muchaka cha makome chita na ubhele hade makome chita na ncheche pabhelwika njwe Yecho Kilichitu. Pange iwechekana kipinde chenie ndi ukibhe ubhandikila ujhomolelo gwa ughome gwa Pauli. Pauli akibha pahina na Timocheyo, pipipi ankemita mwana mundo, Filemone, mu chula jha 2:22, Timocheyo mu chula jha 1:2,18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jhenje ndi jhimo pakate jha baluwa ncheche ya Pauli yajhandikwe kwa bhando kajhika na chi kwa lilongo lya bhando lilinyeketii Kilichitu. Baluwa henge itato ndi baluwa jha ubhele kwa Timocheyo na kwa Titu na kwa Filemone. Kitabo cha kutumbula cha Timocheyo kilongelela mambu gha mahena hake ilongelela panane ya kunnyinamii Chapanga, muchula jha 2:1-15, chipwa chibhipala kubhe nako ilongoche ya bhubhajheketile muchula jha 3:1-13, na lupwato kwa bhabhola bhuwange muchula jha 1:3-11, 6:2-5. Jhenje ilangii Pauli pubhakibha imola Timocheyo kubhehe kilongoche jwa lilongo lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu. Kitabo cha kutumbula cha Timocheyo kibhii na malaghilo ghamahele ghighahoto kwatangatila ilongoche ya bhando bhibhanyeketii Kilichitu mu machiko ghanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli itumbu kwa kunnyambucha Timocheyo, mu chula jha 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli impwatalila Timocheyo akichunge na bhabhola bha uwange, mu chula jha 1:3-11.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ajhendelela kuchenguu ngita hela chabhile kwa nhwalo gwa Yecho Kilichitu, muchula jha 1:12-19.</para>
  <para style="io">Yene Pauli impe malaghilo Timocheyo nhwalo gwa kunnyinami Chapanga na ilongoche ya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu, mu chula jha 2-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ijhomolee baluwa jhake kwa kumpe Timocheyo malaghilo gha kujhomolela, mu chula jha 4-6.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Ne Pauli, natenga jwa Yecho Kilichitu kwa nhwilo gwa Chapanga ndi Nkomboche gwito na Yecho Kilichitu ndi lihobholelo lito.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Ninnyandikila Timocheyo mwanango jwa chakaka mu kihobholelo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Ninnyope umbone na kiya na uteeke kuhumii kwa Chapanga Tate gwito na Yecho Kilichitu Bhambo gwito.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lupwato panane jha mabholo ghuwange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Mbala ntame kwenio ku Epecho, ngita punipembelikiya punikibha nikajhenda ku Makedoniya. Bhabhii bhando bhange kwenio bhibhola mabholo ghuwange, makanakiye bhando bheniya. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Mwalobholela bhaleka kulingukiya kwamahele mu ibheluko pamonga na malobhe gha akahoko, gheniya ghileta kutaungana tu, ghichenga jhe lihengo lya Chapanga mu kihobholelo. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Kilebhe kikolongwa cha malaghalikilo ghango ndi upalo, ghuubhoka mumwojho gwambone, na kuhaghuu na kuhenga ghambone na kihobholelo cha uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Bhando bhange bhahobhalile na kughalambukila mu malongocho gha kimbebhebhe. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Bhipala kubhehe bhabhola bha malaghalikilo gha Mucha, nambo bhimanya ndeka chibhalongela amu malobhe ghabhe bhene amu mambu ghibhajhoha.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Tumanya Malaghalikilo ndi ghambone, anda ghatumike chiipalwa. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Helahela tumanya kubhehe Lilaghalikilo liletitwe kwa nhwalo gwa bhando bhambone jhe, nambo kwa bhando bhangakamuu lilaghalikilo, bhangajhokanikiya, bhangannyopa Chapanga na akahako, bhando bhibhakengama gha nnema na bhangamanya ndela jha Chapanga, bhando bhibhakoma akatate bhabhe na akama jhe bhabhe, amu bhibhakoma bhando. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Lilaghalikilo liletitwe kunhwalo gwa bhibhahenga ngongola, bhibhagholoka na akanalome ajhabhe, bhibhakwatuu bhando, akawange na bhilapii kuwange amu bhihenga kilebhe chochoha chikibhii kuyeto na mabholo gha uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Mabholo gheniya ghabhii mu Lilobhe lya Mbone lya Chapanga jhuna ung'alicho ndi lilobhe limbekiwe nenga natangachila bhando.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiya jha Chapanga kwa Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Ninchenguu Yecho Kilichitu Bhambo gwito jwambekii makakala kunhwalo amwene ne ndi nihobholeka, ngahagwila nintumikila, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />pamonga na makacho ninighita na kwang'aha na kwatende chanake bhando bhinnyeketeketii Kilichitu. Nambo Chapanga ngamonila kiya, kwa nhwalo nakibha nalindindilima kabhele nanga kihobholelo. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Nambo Bhambo gwito ngandweleya twe umbone, ngambekiya kihobholelo na upalo mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Lilobhe lende ndi lya chakaka, kabhele ipalwa kujheketelwa na kuhobholeka. Kilichitu Yecho pahikita pannema pano kwakombola bhando bhubhabhii na uhakaho. Na nenga nnemwite hake kupeta bhando bhoha, <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />nambo Chapanga ngamonila kiya ndi kupala Kilichitu Yecho alangiye luhimbililo lwoha kwa nenga mii nauhakaho kupeta bhoha, ngita nnandanikiho kwa bhala bhoha bhibhapala kunnyeketela na kupokela ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Kwa Munahota Nkolongwa jwangawegha machiko ghoha ghangapeta, jwangahwe, jwanga bhonekana, ndi Chapanga kanjika ndo, kwa jwenio kubhii na ichima na ung'alicho gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta! Amina.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timocheyo ndi mwanango mu kihobholelo, ninkamuwa nhwilo ghongo, kwa malobhe gha ulondole ghighalongilwa panane jhino makacho mughakengame ndi uhoto kuikengelela ngondo jha Malobhe gha Mbone, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />na mukikamulile kihobholelo chino na kupala mme na mwojho gwa kuhaghula ghakuhenga ghighabhii ghambone. Bhando bhange bhakanite gheniya, yenio bhakihangabhine kihobholelo chabhe. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Pakate jhabhe ndi Humeneyo na Alekichanda, bheniya ninkamwii Limbembela, abhabhole kupala bhakoto kunnigha Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Malaghilo gha kunnyopa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Kilebhe chukutumbula, nipala munnyope Chapanga ilebhe imupala, munnyinamila Chapanga, na mwajhopele bhando bhange na munnombe Chapanga kwa nhwalo gwa bhando bhoha. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Munnyope Chapanga kwa nhwalo gwa akanahota na bhando bhibhalongocha, ndi kupala ntame maha na kwa uteeke, kuhenga ghambone na kunnyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ilebhe henge yambone na inhalalicha Chapanga, jwabhii Nkomboche gwito, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />jwenio ndi apala bhando bhoha bhaghombolelwe na bhaumanye uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Nhwalo abhii Chapanga jhumo, na hele abhii jhumo jwajhelanicha bhando na Chapanga, mundo jwenio ndi Kilichitu Yecho, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />jwenio ngangipihita ngita litambiko kwakombola bhando bhoha. Ughombokeko ghongo ubhoneka mu kipinde chake. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Kwa nhwalo gwa gheniya nenga ndumitwe ngita natenga nabhola bhando bhangaumanya Chapanga, ndangache lilobhe lya kihobholelo na lya uchakaka. Nenga nilonge jhe uwange, nilonge uchakaka!<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Bhahe, popoha pala pimikongana kunnyopa Chapanga, nipala bhando bhibhabhii na mwojho gwamaha, bheniya bhahoto kutondobheya mabhoko ghabhe na kunnyopa Chapanga changabhehe na lilaka hilu mitaho. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Kabhele nipala akakeghe bhawale ngobho yambone na ya ichima, na chi kwa kukilemba kwa kutibha mangongo gha chaabo na lulo, andajhe kwa maghanga ghighachuluchwa kwa bei ngolongwa, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />nambo bhabha na itendwa yambone ngita chiipalwa kwa akakeghe bhibhannyopa Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Akakeghe bhipalwa kutama nuu na kubhehe na utembekelo pibhakibhola Lilobhe lya Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Ne nipala jhe mwikeghe ammola amu kuntamila munalome, mwikeghe ipalwa atama nuu. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Nhwalo Adamo jwakalongolile kupanganwa, kubhoke peniya ngapanginwa Hawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Hilu Adamo jhe jwakakolwiwe, nambo mwikeghe ndi jwakakolwiwe, ngalemwiya Lilaghalikilo lya Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Nambo mwikeghe nalondwa papapa yana, anda bhajhendelii mu kihobholelo na upalo na unyahinyahi na matyangilo ghamaha.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Ilongoche ya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Lilobhe lende ndi lya chakaka, mundo jwapala kubhehe kilongoche jwa bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu, jwenio ighana lihengo lyambone. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Bhahe, kilongoche jwa bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu ipalwa abhaha mundo jwantemulana ilebhe maha, abhaha na mwikeghe jhumo, abhaha jwahoto kukilongocha jwenio, jwajhokanikilwa na jwapokela akaghene na jwahoto kubhola bhando, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />jwangalobhela amu mundo jwanga kijhonga, nambo abhaha jwanuu jwapala uteeke na angabhehe jhe jwakupala mbijha. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Ipalwa abhaha mundo jwahoto kwalongocha bhando bha pakajhake maha na aitenda yana yake bhannyokonikiye changa nkanila na ichima hake. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Anda mundo ahoto jhe kwalongocha maha bhando bha ukajhake, nahotolabho kulilongocha likunde lya bhando lilinnyeketii Chapanga? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Apalwa jhe kubhehe mundo jwannyeketii Kilichitu ngohengohe nhwalo ahoto kuloka na kuhadabulwa ngita chahadabwilwe Limbembela. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Ipalwa atopele na bhando bhangannyekete Kilichitu, kupala akoto kugwelele muhone na muntambo gwa Limbembela.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhakujhangatii mu lilongo lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Bhakujhangatii mu lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu bhipalwa bhabha na matyangilo ghamaha, bhina kuhobholeka na bhilonge chakaka chika bhangalobhela divaye na bhando bhakupala tama jha kupata mbijha kwa ndela mboho, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />bhipalwa bhaikamula kwa mwojho gwambone uchakaka mu kihobholelo chikiyekulilwe na Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Hote bhipalwa bhajhigwa, anda bhabhonikine bhakwetii jhe malemo, mwaleke bhabha akajhangatii mu lilongo lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Akahana bhabhe hele bhipalwa bhabha na matyangilo ghambone, bhangang'wenya bhando, bhitemulana ilebhe maha na bhihobholeka mu ilebhe yoha. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Jwantangatii lihengo pa bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu ipalwa abhaha na mwikeghe jhumo tu, na jwahoto kulongocha maha yana mundo na nyumba jhake. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Nhwalo jwantangatii lihengo maha ahoto kujhema nganganga nu kulonge lilobhe lya kihobholelo chake mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho changajhoghopa.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lupwepo lukolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Ninyandikii ghanga na kongo nihobholela kuhika kajhino machiko ghighabhandakii. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Nambo anda njeliwe, bhahe, ghanga ghininnyandikile itenda umanye chimitama munyumba jha Chapanga, ndi lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketiii Kilichitu ndi Chapanga jwabhii ghome, jwenio ndi luheke na nchinge gwa uchakaka. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Ubhii jhe bwoghohe gwogwoha panane jha uyekulilo gwa lupwepo lwa kihobholelo chito chikibhii kikolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Akabhonakine muyegha jha kimundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">jwakalangiwe na Uhuke gwa Chapanga kubhehe ndi jwambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akabhonikine na ntumiche jwa kunane kwa Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Akatangichwe mu ilambo yoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akahobholike munnema gwoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">akatolitwe kujhenda kunane kwa Chapanga mu ung'alicho.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Akabhola bhuuwange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Uhuke gwa Chapanga ulonge hotuhotu kubhehe machiko ghighahika bhando bhange nabhakikana kihobholelo, ndi nabhaijhokaniya ihuke yuuwange na kukengama mabholo gha michuka. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Mabholo ngita gheniya ghitangachwa na bhando bhuuwange na bhibhakitenda bhaumbone, bheniya miojho jhabhe jhukumanya lyambone amu lyanganandela ihwile ngita ijhochwite na choma cha mwotu. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Bhando bheniya ubhola kulemwa kutolela na kulyegha yakulya henge. Nambo Chapanga jwapangina yenie, kupala bhibhannyeketii bhalyeghe na bhaumanye uchakaka kwa kuchengula. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Kila kilebhe chapangine Chapanga ndi chambone, kibhii jhe chikipalwa kukanwa, nambo yoha ipokelelwa kukunchenguu Chapanga, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />nhwalo lilobhe lya Chapanga na kunnyopa kukiteii kilebhe chenie kijheketelwe na Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumiche jwambone jwa Kilichitu Yecho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Anda mapekii akalongo bhoha malaghilo ghanga, namma matumiche bhambone bha Kilichitu Yecho, anda ntei gheniya mabhene nanyendelela kukola mu uhuke kwa malobhe gha kihobholelo na mabholo ghamaha ghamikengama. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Nambo mwe ma Timacheyo mikane omo yangabhehe ya Chapanga na yanganandela. Mukibhole kutama kukunhalalicha Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Kutenda machoechi gha yegha ndi kilebhe chamaha, nambo kutama kukuhalalicha Chapanga ndi kwambone hake mu kila kilebhe, nhwalo atulaghii ughome nhyono na ughome ghupakuhika. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Lilobhe lende ndi lya chakaka hake na lipalwa lijheketelwa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Twenga tung'ahika nu kuhenga mahengo kwa kughagha hake, nhwalo hote tummekii lihobholelo lito Chapanga jwabhii ghome kabhele ndi Nkomboche jwa bhando bhoha, achwa bhala bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Yene mapele malaghilo ghanga na mabhole ilebhe henge. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Mangajheketela mundo jhojhoha ampucha nhwalo mwe makangombo, nambo nkachane mme nnandanikiho kwa bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu, mu kulonge kwino na kutama kwino na mu kihobholelo chino na mupalo gwino na unyahinyahi gwino. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Machiko ghoha nnyendelela kwachome bhando pakongoloho Majhandiko gha Chapanga, kutangacha na kubhola ade pambakuhika. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Mangaleka jhe kutumii kitoi chimpokii kuhumii kwa Uhuke gwa Chapanga chikibhii nkate jhino, chimpatite kupete kwa malobhe gha akalondole bha Chapanga na kummeke mabhoko na kwajhopela bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Nhwachila hake gheniya ghoha na mughahengela lihengo na kila mundo alola chimujhendele kukola. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Mukilolekeya mwe mabhene na mabholo ghino. Nnyendelela kughakamuu gheniya, nhwalo anda ntei yenie, namikighombola mabhene na bhando bhibhannyokanikiya.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Chiipalwa kutama na jwanyeketii Kilichitu nnyino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Mangampwatalila jhe mundo munahota, nambo nnonge nako ngita tate gwino. Nnongele na achikangombo ngita akalongo bhino. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Nnonge nabho akakeghe imbujha ngita akamajhe bhino, na achikabhale nnonge nabho ngita akalombo bhino, kwa unyahinyahi gwoha.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Mwatendele ghambone akakeghe akanawela bhangabhehe na kilebhe chochoha. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Nambo nawela jwabhii na yana amu ichokolo, yenie ipalwa bhakibhole ghapala Chapanga, bhabhujhichila mabhoko akatate bhabhe na akahoko bhabhe, nhwalo ghihalalicha Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Mwikeghe jwabhii nawela chakaka, jwanga mundo jwa kuntangatila, jwenio abhii na lihobholelo na ajhendelele kunnyopa Chapanga atangatila kilo na muhe. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Nambo nawela jwaitama kwa kukipala jwenio, jwenio abhii ngita awile, pamo nukubhehe ghome. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Malobholela bhando bhahenga ilebhe yenie, kupala angapitii jhe jwa kukokoleka. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Anda mundo abhahwachii jhe akalongo mundo, mundo jwenio akwete jhe kihobholelo, ndi jwanganandela kuliku jwanganyeketela Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Manganyandika jhe mu kitabo cha akanawela mundo jwangahikicha yaka makome chita. Kabhele abha jwatolilwe mala jhimo, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />na abhaha jwamanyikine kwa mahengo ghake ghambone, jwalelite yana yake maha na jwabhalendekeya akaghene kajhake na jwabhapoke bhando bha Chapanga na kwagholola magholo na kwatangatii bhando bhina malola, jwakitabhite kukamuu ghambone.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Nambo mangajhandika jhe akanawela ichikana, nhwalo tama yabhe yakupalwa kutolelwa nakanalome kabhele bhihoto kughalambuka na bhihoto kunneka Kilichitu. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Yene nabhabha na malemo gha kuleka lilaghano lyabhe lya makacho. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Akanawela ngita bheniya bhikibhola utotoho na kutumbuu kubheghe nyumba na nyumba, chi utotoho tu, nambo helahela kibhoho bhitumbukana kwang'enya ajhabhe na kujhingilii mu ilebhe ya bhando bhange na kone bhilonge malobhe ghangapalwa kulonge. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Kwa yenio, nipala akanawela ichikana bhatolelwe na akanalome, bhapapa yana na kuilejhemelela nyumba yabhe kupala likoko lino likoto kulonge lijhambu lyanganandela pakate jhino. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Nhwalo akanawela bhange bhahobhalile na kunkengama Limbembela. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Nambo anda majhe jwanyeketii Kilichitu akwete akanawela munyumba jhake, bheniya bhipalwa kujhemelelwa na chi kulileke nhwigho lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu. Kupala lilongo lilinnyeketii kilichitu lihoto kwajhemelela akanawela bhala bhangabhehe na kilebhe chochoha.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Ilongoche bhibhajhemele maha bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu, ipalwa atopelwa hake, achwa jhola jwahenga lihengo lya kwatangachii bhando na kwabhola. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Nhwalo Majhandiko gha Chapanga ghilonge, “Nkotoka kuntabha nnomo ng'ombi piihuna,” na helahela, “Nhenga lihengo ipalwa alepwa malepo ghake.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Mangapoke jhe litakalilo lya munahota lyangajheketelwa na lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu, bhando bhabhele amu bhatato. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Bhibhajhendelela kuhenga uhakaho makanikiya pa bhando twe, kupala bhando bhange bhajhoghope.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ninaghalikiya palonge jha Chapanga na palonge jha Kilichitu Yecho na palonge jha akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga, nkoto kuhadabuu kajhombe, mangahaghuu jhe mundo kwa kunnolekeya kumiho. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Mangajhomboteka kummeke mundo mabhoko. Nkoto kujhingii mu uhakaho gwa bhando bhange. Ntame kwa kunhalalicha Chapanga.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Manganywe mache tu, nambo unywa divaye kandina kunhwalo jha lutumbo lwino, nhwalo gwa ulwalo ghumilwalwa pipipi.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Uhakaho gwa bhando bhange ubhonekana hotuhotu, kabula jha kuhadabulwa, bhando bhange uhakaho gwabhe ubhonekana jhe ade pibhahadabulwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Helahela lihengo lyamaha libhonekana hotuhotu na ata yangabhonekana hotuhotu hele ihoto jhe kukihiya.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Akabhanda bhoha bhipalwa bhanyenyekeya akanahota bhabhe kupala bhando bhakoto kuliligha liina lya Chapanga andajhe mabholo ghito. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Akabhanda bhubhabhii na akanahota bhabhe bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu bhangapucha jhe akanahota kwa bhikihwananicha ngita Akakilichitu ajhabhe. Nambo bhipalwa kwatumikila maha hake, nhwalo bheniya ndi bhibhajhambulila kuhumii mu mahengo ghabhe, bhibhahobholeka na bhibhapalwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Mabholo ghu uwange na kichumo cha chakaka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Yene ndi chimipalwa kubhola na kutangacha malobhe gheniya. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Mundo jhojhoha jwaibhola mabholo ghange ghangabhehe tela na ghanga, na jwangajheketela malobhe gha chakaka gha Bhambo gwito Kilichitu Yecho na kutama ngita chapala Chapanga, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />jwenio atwelii kulokaloka na amanyite jhe kilebhe chochoha. Mundo jwatamii mitaho na bhulo na maligho na kuwachii bhange ghanganandela, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />na mitaho jhangajhomoka kubhoka kwa bhando bheniya, malango ghabhe ghapoghanike kabhele nabhangabhehe na uchakaka. Bheniya bhihwacha kuntumikii Chapanga ndi ndela jha kichumo cha mbijha.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Chakaka kuntumikii Chapanga kummeka mundo abhaha na ulohe, anda ajheketela kubhehe atochike na ilebhe yakwete. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Nhwalo tuhikite jhe na kilebhe chochoha pannema pano, hilu natughegha jhe kilebhe chochoha pitujhenda kunane kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Yene, anda tukwete yakulyegha na ngobho, tupalwa tutocheka kubhehe na yenio. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Nambo bhala bhibhapala kubhehe na kichumo ugwegha mu majhighinikilo na mu ntambo gwa tama jha ghanganandela na undindilima ghighapeleka kuhobha na mukomelekelo. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Nhwalo kupala hake mbijha ndi kihokola cha mahakaho ghoha. Bhando bhange bhiloke hake kubhehe na mbijha ade kukileka kutale kihobholelo na kuijhocha miojho jhabhe kwa lipyanda kwa ghala ghibhahenga.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo kwa Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Nambo mwe, mamundo bha Chapanga, muibhambale ilebhe yenio. Nnyendelela kubhehe mambone palonge jha Chapanga, mtembekeya Chapanga na mme na kihobholelo na mme na upalo na mma naluhimba na mma manuu. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Nkachane hake kukomana ngondo jha kihobholelo nkamule ughome gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta, ughome Chapanga gwankemii pala pinnyeketila mabhene kihobholelo chino palonge jha bhando twe bhubhakibha peniya. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ninaghila palonge jha Chapanga jwaipe ughome ilebhe yoha, na palonge jha Kilichitu Yecho jwalongela uchakaka palonge jha Pontiyo Pilatu, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />nkamule malaghilo ghanga na kughajhokanikiya na ntende kwa kuhobholeka ade lichiko lela lyapala kubhujha Bhambo gwito Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Kubhujha kwakwe Yecho nakuhengeka machiko ghighabhekwitwe na Chapanga, jwenio jwabhii na ung'alicho, jwabhii Kilongoche kanjika ndo, jwenio jwabhii Bhambo jwa Mabhambo. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Jwenie kajhika ndo itama machiko ghoha ghangapeta mu lumule lwangahoto kuheghelelwa na mundo. Abhii jhe mundo jwahotwii kummona hilu jwahoto kummona. Ndi jhuna ichima na uhotolo gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta! Amina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Mwalaghalikiye bhando bhubhabhii na kichumo munnema ghongo gwa ngohe, bhangalokajhe, peniya bhaleke kuhobholela ulohe gwangahoto kuyobholeka nambo bhanhobholela Chapanga jwatupeke ghoha kwa umbone tuhangane. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Mwalaghalikiye bhahenga ghambone, bhabha na itendwa twe yambone na bhabha bhaumbone na bhajheketela kwabhaghulii bhange ilebhe yabhe. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Kwa kuhenga gheniya nakwatangatila kubhehe na kihukilo kibhehe nchinge nganganga na peniya nabhahotola kukipatii ughome gwa chakaka.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Mwe ma Timocheyo, mughalolekeye ghala ghoha ghinkamwiwe. Mmambale malobhe ghangabhehe gha Chapanga na ghanganandela na mataungano gha undindilima ndi bhando kwa uwange bhighakema, “Kumanya.” <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Nhwalo bhando bhange bhakilokita kumanya kwenio kupeta undindilima, na kuhenga yenio bhahobhii kihobholelo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Umbone gwa Chapanga utama na mangota!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>